&lt;p&gt;Our customers include the world’s largest and most prominent healthcare systems, governments, retailers, restaurants and global businesses who rely on us to save lives, reduce emissions, increase economic opportunity, and provide delivery from point A to point B as fast as possible. The drone is only 15% of what we’ve built to enable seamless, reliable, global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our system strengthens supply chains, reduces congestion, and gives people time back. With more than 140 million commercial autonomous miles safely flown, Zipline is redefining access to healthcare, consumer products, and food across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate at a global scale and are looking for practical problem solvers who thrive on real-world challenges and rapid growth. Our team is motivated by building systems that have a direct, meaningful impact on people’s lives and by scaling the future of logistics. We are seeking people who sculpt from first principles, enjoy facing adversity, and can do the impossible at record breaking speeds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You and The Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Site Acquisition Associate, you are responsible for creating opportunities that fuel our network expansion. You are a relentless prospector who enjoys the hunt, thrives on outbound outreach, and knows that persistence wins deals. You are energized by building relationships, uncovering opportunities, and turning cold conversations into meaningful business discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for someone with strong sales instincts who wants to develop into a full-cycle dealmaker. You will focus on identifying viable sites, engaging property owners and brokers, qualifying opportunities, and advancing conversations that ultimately lead to signed agreements. As you build experience and demonstrate sound judgment, you will take on increasing responsibility in negotiations and transaction management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are less concerned with prior real estate experience than we are with your ability to generate opportunities, build trust, navigate objections, and consistently drive results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will support network expansion across assigned markets and may require occasional domestic travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Build and Maintain the Pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and research prospective sites that meet expansion criteria across priority markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop target lists of property owners, landlords, brokers, developers, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously source new opportunities to ensure healthy pipeline coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use CRM tools and market research resources to organize and prioritize outreach efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate prospect, site, and pipeline data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Execute High-Volume Outreach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct high-volume outbound outreach through calls, emails, LinkedIn, and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage property owners, brokers, and decision-makers to introduce opportunities and assess interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with prospective site hosts and industry stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain disciplined follow-up cadences and consistently re-engage prospects over extended sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overcome objections and navigate complex stakeholder environments to keep opportunities moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Qualify and Advance Opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather preliminary information regarding site ownership, availability, access, utilities, and general feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct initial qualification against established site criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare site summaries and opportunity briefs for internal review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate exploratory calls, meetings, and site visits with the Site Acquisition Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support negotiations and transaction discussions, assuming greater responsibility over time as experience and performance warrant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Operate with Discipline and Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clean, organized pipeline with accurate forecasting and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track outreach activity, conversion metrics, and opportunity progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface risks, blockers, and recommendations to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improvements in sourcing strategies, outreach messaging, broker engagement, and acquisition playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate ownership of outcomes rather than simply activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently generating qualified site opportunities in priority markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High outbound activity levels paired with strong conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective relationship development with property owners, brokers, and site hosts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable advancement of opportunities from initial outreach through qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing ability to independently manage negotiations and transaction discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy pipeline coverage that supports long-term expansion goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;section-wrapper page-full-width&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–5 years of experience in sales, business development, account management, recruiting, fundraising, market development, or another relationship-driven role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success generating opportunities through cold outreach and persistent follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, persuasion, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle rejection, remain resilient, and maintain consistent activity levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and disciplined pipeline management habits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, competitive, and results-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in developing commercial negotiation and real estate transaction skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel occasionally within assigned markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authorized to work in the United States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in commercial real estate, leasing, retail expansion, telecom, logistics, infrastructure, or related industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to business owners, property owners, or other sophisticated stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce or similar CRM platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of exceeding sales, prospecting, or business development targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed as a pathway into full-cycle site acquisition. High performers will have the opportunity to take on increasing responsibility for negotiations, transaction management, and deal ownership as they build experience and demonstrate success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;content-wrapper posting-page&quot;&gt;What Else You Need to Know&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting cash range for this role is $100,000-130,000. Please note that this is a target, starting cash range for a candidate who meets the minimum qualifications for this role. The final cash pay for this role will depend on a variety of factors, including a specific candidate&#39;s experience, qualifications, skills, working location, and projected impact. The total compensation package for this role may also include: equity compensation; discretionary annual or performance bonuses; sales incentives; benefits such as medical, dental and vision insurance; paid time off; and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Zipline is an equal opportunity employer and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to&amp;nbsp;race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, mental or physical disability, medical condition, genetic information, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, and related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, military or veteran status, citizenship, or other characteristics protected by state, federal or local law or our other policies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We value diversity at Zipline and welcome applications from those who are traditionally underrepresented in tech. If you like the sound of this position but are not sure if you are the perfect fit, please apply!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

abstractvc-garner-health:greenhouse:6013.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Garner’s mission is to transform the healthcare economy, delivering high-quality and affordable care for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are fundamentally reimagining how healthcare works in the U.S. by partnering with employers to redesign healthcare benefits using clear incentives and powerful, data-driven insights. Our approach guides employees to higher-quality, lower-cost care, creating a system that works better for everyone. Patients achieve better health outcomes, employers spend healthcare dollars more effectively, and physicians are rewarded for delivering exceptional care rather than performing more procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Garner is one of the fastest-growing healthcare technology companies in the country. Our products are trusted by the most sophisticated employers and providers in the industry, and we are building a team of talented, mission-driven individuals who are motivated to make a meaningful impact on healthcare at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our organization. Garner’s Engineering team tackles incredibly hard technical problems for a mission that truly matters. Our systems analyze billions of medical records to rank healthcare providers across the country. We are an AWS + Kubernetes shop, and we are constantly introducing new technologies as our system load doubles every year. We expect our engineers to champion cutting-edge industry practices as we aggressively embrace AI in every facet of our operations and norms. We are seeking teammates who take pride in delivering their best work while fostering a strong team culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where you will work:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Garner is headquartered in NYC, but this position is available for individuals who are comfortable with remote work and occasional travel to HQ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead team-level technical strategy and execution on multi-quarter time horizons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to build, optimize, and maintain software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uplevel engineers across the organization by raising the technical bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across disciplines to understand our domain and iterate on projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect our users’ privacy and security through best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams of engineers with demonstrated impact on technical strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A generalist software engineering mindset ready to learn new languages, frameworks, and techniques required for a fast paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build complex systems using AI coding agents (we use Claude Code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to learn quickly and mentor others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data security and HIPAA compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to be a part of a high-performing, mission-driven team that operates with intense urgency, a strong sense of individual accountability, and a commitment to authentic feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies we use:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude Code, Kubernetes, AWS, Airflow, DBT, Python, TypeScript, React, Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join a fast-growing company in a transformative role, helping shape the future of healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The target salary range for this position is $275,000 - $300,000. Individual compensation for this role will depend on various factors, including qualifications, skills, and applicable laws. In addition to base compensation, this role is eligible to participate in our equity incentive and competitive benefits plans, including but not limited to: flexible PTO, Medical/Dental/Vision plan options, 401(k), Teladoc Health and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud and Security Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of recent job scam attempts. Our recruiters use &lt;a href=&quot;http://getgarner.com/&quot;&gt;getgarner.com&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;garnerhealth.com&quot;&gt;garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt; email domains exclusively. If you have been contacted by someone claiming to be a Garner recruiter or a hiring manager from a different domain about a potential job, please report it to law enforcement &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ic3.gov/Home/ComplaintChoice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidateprotection@getgarner.com&quot;&gt;candidateprotection@garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
Garner Health is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and values diversity in the workplace. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.
&lt;p&gt;Garner Health is committed to providing accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our recruiting process. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@getgarner.com&quot;&gt;talent@garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7942567.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Position: Seller Service Specialist, Seller Support team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;作為 &lt;strong&gt;Seller Service Specialist（賣家服務專員）&lt;/strong&gt;，你將在強化賣家支援團隊能力方面扮演關鍵角色，透過管理升級案件（escalations）與優化營運流程，確保賣家能獲得卓越且一致的支援體驗。此職位將透過數據導向策略與持續改善計畫，提升賣家滿意度與團隊整體績效。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;負責追蹤並處理尚未解決的 Coupang 確認請求（confirmation request）補償案件，針對 Tier 1 客服未能解決的案件提供指引，並即時回應賣家補償方案相關問題&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;建立並執行高效率的補償申請處理流程，確保符合公司政策與相關規範&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;優化案件升級（escalation）流程，以提升整體賣家體驗與滿意度&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;提出並落實相關政策建議，以優化賣家管理機制並提升內部營運效率&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;分析數據與績效指標，找出營運改善機會，並簡化與優化工作流程&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;必要條件（Essential Qualifications）：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;具學士學位尤佳&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;3 年以上 Seller Support、Customer Operations 或相關領域工作經驗&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;具備優秀的分析能力、問題解決能力與溝通能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;具備良好的口語與書面表達能力，能清楚傳達複雜資訊&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;熟悉 MS Excel、MS Word 與 PowerPoint；具 SQL 知識者佳&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;熟悉 Zendesk、Jira 等工單／票務系統者高度優先&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;能同時處理多項任務，並適應快速變動、節奏緊湊的工作環境&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;具備良好英文能力；具韓文能力者為加分條件&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7955910.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;会社概要&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang, Inc.（以下クーパン）の完全子会社であるCP&amp;nbsp;One&amp;nbsp;Japan合同会社は、新たなフードデリバリーアプリ「Rocket&amp;nbsp;Now（ロケットナウ）」の提供を東京都内の一部地域で開始しました。CP&amp;nbsp;One Japan合同会社は、Coupang,&amp;nbsp;Inc.（NYSE:&amp;nbsp;CPNG）の完全子会社です。Coupang,&amp;nbsp;Inc.はNYSE（ニューヨーク証券取引所）に上場しているFortune&amp;nbsp;150&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;企業の一つで、テクノロジー企業として知られています。CP One Japanは、日本国内で「Rocket Now」ブランドのフードデリバリーサービスを提供しており、クーパンの技術力と革新的な物流ソリューションを活かして、迅速で信頼性の高い顧客志向のフードデリバリーサービスを日本の消費者に提供することに尽力しています。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;募集職種&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;日本のHRチームにて、実行力の高いHRプログラムマネージャーを募集しています。本ポジションは、強いプロジェクトマネジメント力を持ち、HR領域でキャリアを築きたい方に最適です。HR経験は必須ではなく、リクルーティングやプログラム／プロジェクトマネジメントの経験をお持ちの方を歓迎します。&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;主な業務内容&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HR関連プロジェクトおよびプログラムの企画・推進（End-to-Endでの管理・実行）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;採用チーム、ビジネスリーダー、HR関係者との連携による採用および組織施策の支援&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;HR業務のプロセス改善およびオペレーション効率化の推進&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;クロスファンクショナルなステークホルダーとの調整およびアラインメントの確保&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;採用活動のサポート（パイプライン管理、面接調整、候補者体験の向上など）&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;指標のトラッキングおよびデータ分析による意思決定支援・改善提案&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;応募資格&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;基本資格&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;プロジェクト／プログラムマネジメントの実務経験（複数タスクの同時管理能力）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW245608929 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;JA-JP&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW245608929 BCX0&quot;&gt;高いコミュニケーション能力およびステークホルダーマネジメント力&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW245608929 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
