&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We’re looking for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;QA Lead &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;to join our team. You will be responsible for leading the overall quality assurance strategy, test planning, execution, and automation for software applications. This role involves overseeing the team of QA analysts, collaborating with development and product teams, and implementing best practices to ensure software quality, performance, and security. The ideal candidate has a deep understanding of manual and automated testing processes and is experienced in leading QA teams in Agile environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:432}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
