&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with NGS, ctDNA, and molecular oncology preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
