&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a Lasting Impact as a Companion/Buddy for People with Disabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;**Join the Kauai Habilitation Team — &lt;em&gt;$1,000 Sign-On Bonus!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Rate: $20/hr**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Habilitation is seeking compassionate and motivated individuals to join our team as &lt;strong&gt;Habilitation Technicians&lt;/strong&gt;—Companions/Buddies who support individuals with intellectual and developmental disabilities in building independence and reaching their goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a meaningful opportunity for anyone passionate about helping others live fulfilling, self-directed lives. No experience required—just heart, patience, and the desire to make a difference.&amp;nbsp; We offer PAID training to support you in your journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-lasting, one-on-one relationships with a flexible schedule to fit around your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend time doing fun, meaningful activities—like exercise, hobbies, community events, or rewarding programs like Special Olympics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support clients in skill-building (budgeting, socializing, shopping, transportation, exercise, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide care with dignity, respect, and attentiveness to each individual’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote safety and well-being in both home and community settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the beauty of Kauai while making a positive impact as a supportive Buddy!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits You’ll Love&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
